---
title: Amaretto Chicken Pasta Sauce
source.name: Originals
tags: Alcohol, Originals, Sides
---

Sautee @chicken breast{8%oz}(diced) in @Amaretto{1/4%cup} & @olive oil{1%Tbsp}
until absorbed and amaretto is carmelized on the chicken.

Add remaining @Amaretto{1%tbsp} and @mushroom pieces{2%oz}(drained), sautee until amaretto is absorbed.

Add @tomato sauce{30%oz}, @garlic powder{1%tsp}, @onion salt{1%tsp}, @paprika{1%tsp},
@cumin{1/2%tsp}, @cayenne pepper{1/2%tsp}, and @dried sage{1/2%tsp}
Heat through.

Serve over @pasta.
